WEBVTT

44:03.584 --> 44:05.669
But he was tough, Ned,

44:05.794 --> 44:07.046
a true ranger.

44:07.171 --> 44:08.672
(SCOFFS)

44:08.797 --> 44:10.549
He was talking madness.

44:11.759 --> 44:13.510
Said the walkers slaughtered his friends.

44:13.636 --> 44:15.930
The two he was with are still missing.

44:17.598 --> 44:21.060
Hmph. A wildling ambush.

44:22.061 --> 44:23.145
Maybe.

44:24.438 --> 44:26.982
Direwolves south of the Wall,

44:27.107 --> 44:29.318
talk of the walkers,

44:29.443 --> 44:31.987
and my brother might be
the next Hand of the King.
